---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="近况 · Ze'Yan" description="Ze'Yan 的近况（Now 页）">
  <article class="prose now reveal">
    <header class="now-head">
      <p class="section-kicker">近况</p>
      <h1>Now</h1>
      <p class="lead">这一阵子在忙些什么——更新于 2026 年夏。</p>
    </header>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <div class="now-body">
      <p>最近在…</p>
      <ul class="now-list">
        <li>重做个人站点，尝试「编辑杂志风」的版式与排版语言。</li>
        <li>读《<em>Thinking, Fast and Slow</em>》，顺带整理一些阅读笔记。</li>
        <li>练习长曝光摄影，周末常去江边与旧城区扫街。</li>
        <li>把日常开发环境迁移到 Arch Linux + Hyprland，折腾平铺窗口管理。</li>
        <li>保持每周两次长跑，目标下半年完成一场半程马拉松。</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        这个页面受 <a href="https://nownownow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >nownownow.com</a
        > 启发，记录「此刻」而非「全部」。它会随生活节奏慢慢变化。
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .now {
    padding: 40px 0;
  }

  .now-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
    margin: 8px 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .now-body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-family: "Noto Serif SC", var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .now-body :global(p) {
    margin: 0 0 1.2em;
  }

  .now-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .now-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 12px 0 12px 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .now-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .now-list li::before {
    content: "§";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 12px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
